=2 Walkthrough
* Wait one in game day after clearing {q:Vegetable Vegetable Crisis|Vegetable Vegetable Crisis|Vegetable Vegetable Crisis}.
** Finish {q:Cid's Secret|Cid's Secret|Cid's Secret} and {q:The Usual|The Usual|The Usual} Bastok quests
* Check Amchuchu's Laboratory at the Inventor's Coalition in {z:Western Adoulin} (J-10) for a cutscene.
* Head to the {z:Metalworks} in {p:Bastok} and speak with {p:Raibaht} at (G-8).
* Go to {z:Palborough Mines} Map 3 (G-8) and examine the **__Peculiar Fissure**__.
** Home point to {z:Palborough Mines} is fastest way.
* Bang on the rock three times and then think.
* Return to {p:Raibaht}.
* Go to the {z:Adoulin Waterfront Waypoint|Western Adoulin} in {z:Western Adoulin} and examine the **__Contemplation Site**__ at (I-5).
** Trade it a {p:Sabiki Rig} to obtain {@k} {k:Packet of Midras's explosives}.
* Return to the **__Peculiar Fissure**__ and examine it for a short cutscene.
* Examine it again to spawn **{m:Incensed Pineapple}**, a bomb NM.
** Players not advanced to this point in the quest cannot participate in the fight. Players that have completed this quest may participate.
** The bomb must be defeated before it uses self-destruct. Difficult fight if not properly prepared.
*** Dispelling its Berserk effect right away will keep it from using self-destruct. Blaze spikes is repetitively used and will interfere with dispelling and require using multiple dispels or stuns.
*** Bomb will spam either Berserk or Blaze Spikes as soon as either is dispelled.
**** Simplest way to approach the fight is stack dispel Trusts along with stuns. BLU's head-butt spam makes this fight almost trivial.
***** Some Trusts that use Dispel include Qultada, Koru-Moru, Arciela (I or II), Ovjang, and Ajido-Marujido.
***** Trust weaponskills that don't hit hard are fine. Take your time, just melee while focusing on dispels and stuns and let trusts assist you with both.
** If it uses self-destruct, you must reexamine the **__Contemplation Site**__ then trade another {p:Sabiki Rig} to it for a new key item.
** When it is at 1HP it will attempt to use self-destruct and immediately die without it going off.
* Examine the **__Peculiar Fissure**__ again for a cutscene and the two Key Items: {k:Tarnished ring} (relating to Sirius) and {k:Rusty locket} (relating to Almid).
* Return to {p:Raibaht}.
* Return to the **__Contemplation Site**__ for a cutscene and your reward.

=3 Optional
* Check Amchuchu's Laboratory at the Inventor's Coalition in {z:Western Adoulin} (J-10) for a cutsene and the reward of {i:Midras's Helm +1|Midras's Helm +1|25637}.

